WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,140
Where is Ayu?

2
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,540
Why are you here alone?

3
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,400
Back to my parents’ house

4
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,440
Go back to your parents' home

5
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:22,070
There's so much blood outside, so scary?

6
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,310
Very good

7
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:25,430
Why did you choose to go back at this time?

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,530
She said she was worried about her sister-in-law's health and went back to check on her.

9
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,850
Don't try to make fun of me with these words

10
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:33,610
It's icy and snowy outside

11
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:36,650
Who would choose to run out at this time?

12
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:41,140
Have you made people unhappy these days?

13
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:42,680
Something to be busy with

14
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:44,940
No matter how important it is

15
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,740
Could it be more important than my own wife?

16
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:47,660
in this matter

17
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,060
You are just like your father

18
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,580
A woman marries into her husband's family

19
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,700
All I want is a sincere treatment
